#: ../../source/users/project/new_project.rst:5
msgid "Create new project"
msgstr "创建新项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/new_project.rst:7
msgid ""
"A new `project`_ can be created from `menu bar`_, `toolbar`_ and using the "
"corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"可以从 `项目 <project_>`_，`菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 创建一个新的 `工具栏 "
"<toolbar_>`_，并使用相应的键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/project/new_project.rst:11
msgid "Create new project from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏创建新项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/new_project.rst:13
msgid "Select **File > New** menu item to create a new `project`_."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 新建** 菜单项以创建新的 `项目 <project_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/new_project.rst:18
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech file menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文件菜单"

#: ../../source/users/project/new_project.rst:21
msgid "Create new project from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏创建新项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/new_project.rst:23
msgid ""
"Select the icon |project-new| from `toolbar`_ to create a new `project`_."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |project-new| 以创建新的 `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/new_project.rst:25
msgid "project-new"
msgstr "项目-新"

#: ../../source/users/project/new_project.rst:29
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Tools**"
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 工具** 显示"

#: ../../source/users/project/new_project.rst:32
msgid "Create new project using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键创建新项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/new_project.rst:34
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/project/new_project.rst:36
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + n`` to create a new `project`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + n`` 创建新 `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/new_project.rst:40
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
